      "description": {
        "fun": "On its own Starly is weak and barely noticed, so it lives in huge, noisy flocks, though the members start bickering once a flock gets too big. Don't underestimate it: a strike from its small wings leaves pain that lasts a week. It looks like a young white-cheeked starling, and its cries are famously grating.",
        "guide": "Starly is a small Normal- and Flying-type bird based on a starling. It gathers in large flocks in fields and mountains because it is weak alone, and it hunts Bug Pokémon. It evolves into Staravia and then Staraptor.",
