      "description": {
        "fun": "Staravia knows it's weak, so it never strays from its enormous flock, and when left alone it cries noisily. Flocks are fiercely territorial, and squabbles break out whenever two of them meet. The ones with magnificent plumes on their heads are thought to be the strongest. Its name is a simple mix of starling and avian.",
        "guide": "Staravia is the evolved form of Starly. It lives in huge flocks in forests and fields that clash fiercely over territory, and it hunts Bug Pokémon. It evolves into Staraptor.",
