      "description": {
        "fun": "Once it evolves, Staraptor leaves the flock for good, strong enough to live alone. It is fierce to the point of recklessness, taking on much larger foes and refusing to stop even when hurt, and it fusses over the shape of its comb. Legends: Z-A's Mega Dimension gave it a Mega Evolution, the only one that changes a Pokémon's main type.",
        "guide": "Staraptor is the final form of Starly, a Normal- and Flying-type bird of prey that lives alone once it evolves. It is aggressive and will attack much larger foes, and it can carry other Pokémon in flight. It can Mega Evolve into Mega Staraptor, introduced in the Mega Dimension expansion of Pokémon Legends: Z-A.",
